  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "This brand new 3-story home with elevator is an absolute stunner in a gated neighborhood on the beachside of 30A in Blue Mountain. Featuring 6 bd/6 ba, including a bunk room with 4 full-size bunks with arcade, PS4, & foosball. Tons of outdoor living with 4 balconies including a screened porch, plus a large walkout patio & yard with built-in grill station, ping pong, & cornhole. Take the 6-passenger golf cart & bikes to plenty of nearby restaurants, coffee & ice cream shops!<br><br>☀ 4,200 sq ft of stylish living space<br>☀ 6 Spacious and exquisitely decorated bedrooms; 5 kings, bunk room with 4 full built-in bunks (each with its own with light and charging station). Every bedroom has a large flatscreen smart TV and darkening shades over the windows.<br>☀ 6 bathrooms: 5 ensuites, and 1 full bathroom directly adjacent to bedroom.<br>☀ Large open-concept kitchen w/ modern finishes, gas range, beautiful large island plus 6 stools for hanging out while in the kitchen.<br>☀ 4 Balconies: one screened balcony with an extendable table for outdoor dining or games on the patio and a chaise sofa for relaxing and taking in the magnificent 30A sunsets from our west facing porches.<br>☀ Elevator to help you carry luggage and groceries or if you need to avoid the stairs.<br>☀ Golf cart - brand new 6-seater with bluetooth speakers and upgraded leather seats. Guest required to provide a photo ID (i.e. driver's license) for verification of identity and proof of insurance coverage for using the golf cart.<br>☀ Secret reading nook hideaway off of the bunk room.<br>☀ Built-in outdoor grill station on large covered patio with yard that faces a gorgeous and serene nature preserve that backs up to Draper Lake. Includes ping pong table and cornhole.<br>☀ Kid’s amenities: Pack ‘n’ Play, highchair, children's plates/bowls/utensils.<br>☀ Beach chairs, umbrellas, wagon & Boogie Boards!!<br>☀ Arcade game, foosball, PS4 game console and games, board and card games.<br>☀ Outdoor shower with hot water for rinsing off after a day at the beach.<br>☀ Great location: 3-minute golf cart, 6-minute bike or 12-minute walk to beach, 3 different nearby beach accesses to choose from. Tons of fabulous restaurants, coffee shops and the best ice cream on 30A.<br>☀ Parking: Plenty of parking available between the garage, 2 driveways, and neighborhood parking lot.<br><br>EXTRAS!<br>We have got you covered with everything you need to make your vacation seamless:<br>- a starter kit for essentials: paper towels, toilet paper, linens, towels, dish soap, laundry pods, etc.<br>- All bathrooms come fully equipped with liquid hand soap, body wash, shampoo, and conditioner<br>- Keurig and coffee maker with complimentary coffee.<br>- Beach towels, umbrellas and beach chairs.<br>- Brand new 6-seater golf cart, with bluetooth speakers and upgraded brown leather seats.<br>- 5 complimentary bikes give you the ability to cruise around! Options are endless – you can take The Timpoochee Trail all the way down 30A, to the beach, restaurants or to nearby nature trails and parks.<br>- Laundry room with washer and dryer.<br><br>THE BEDROOMS<br>The Master Suite on 3rd Floor<br>- King size Pottery Barn canopy bed with luxury Leeza Legacy mattress<br>- 65\" Amazon Fire smart TV<br>- private balcony for magnificent sunsets, and coffee or a good book in the mornings.<br>- en-suite bathroom with walk in shower with dual shower heads including a rain head, separate water closet.<br>- walk-in closet<br><br>Guest Suite 1 on 3rd Floor<br>- King size bed<br>- 55” Amazon Fire smart TV<br>- en-suite with a shower and bathtub combination<br><br>Guest Suite 2 on 3rd Floor<br>- King size bed<br>- 55” Amazon Fire smart TV<br>- en-suite with a shower and bathtub combination<br><br>Guest Suite 1 on 2nd Floor<br>- King size bed<br>- 55” Amazon Fire smart TV<br>- en suite with a shower and bathtub combination<br><br>Guest Suite 2 on 2nd Floor<br>- King size bed<br>- 55” Amazon Fire smart TV<br>- adjacent full bath with a shower and bathtub combination<br>- private patio<br><br>The Bunk Room on 1st floor<br>- 2 sets of built-in bunkbeds featuring full beds<br>- en suite bathroom with walk-in shower<br>- 65\" Amazon Fire smart TV, NBA Jam arcade, PS4 and games, foosball<br>- secret hideaway reading nook<br>- access to back porch<br><br>Airport Distances:<br>Destin FL (VPS) - 35 miles<br>Panama City FL (ECP) 36 miles",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
